Source freeze and inventory
The source tree was frozen after the inspector and browser capability work,
module documentation, IDEAS.ztext, root documentation and README.md were final.
SHA256.ztext was then regenerated by zero-sha256 and encoded by zero-text.
The inventory excludes itself; the archive includes it.
