Manifest policy
Original .zero, .ezero, .zero.part, .ztext and .zapp source/text/seed files,
plus owner-approved AGENTS.md, README.md and official LICENSE, are included.
Historical own source and tests remain available. Private data disks, all
.zpix screenshot assets, personal unsent correspondence, .git metadata and
distribution artifacts are excluded. Excluded local originals were preserved.
The 3373 files and 40762945-byte archive fit the original tool's 4096-file
and 64 MiB bounds. No external archive format or compression library is used.

Archive verification and extraction
The manifest was encoded by zero-text. The archive was created, verified and
extracted by original zero-archive from the final 78-artifact reference build.
Every one of the 3373 extracted files matches the frozen project byte for byte.
The complete extracted file list matches the manifest with no extra files.
The exported archive matches the verified private archive byte for byte.
